{"sha": "5272d109234ffb51a8087edb79a60a0669c023a475452c15bc86e4ac7bc056e4", "body": ["\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:affine:11}", "（梅涅劳斯）在三角形 $ABC$ 中，设 $A' \\in (BC)$，$B' \\in", "(CA)$，$C' \\in (AB)$，三点均异于顶点，", "并由下式定义 $\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma$：$\\vect{A'B} =", "\\alpha\\,\\vect{A'C}$，$\\vect{B'C} = \\beta\\,\\vect{B'A}$，", "$\\vect{C'A} = \\gamma\\,\\vect{C'B}$。证明 $A', B', C'$ 共线", "当且仅当 $\\alpha\\beta\\gamma = 1$。\\emph{（将每个点写成", "两个顶点的重心；证明三点共线当且仅当它们", "关于 $(A, B, C)$ 的重心坐标行构成", "奇异的 $3 \\times 3$ 矩阵。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:affine:12}", "设 $K$ 为 $\\R^n$ 的紧子集，证明其凸包是紧的。", "\\emph{（由\\cref{thm:b2:affine:caratheodory}，", "$\\operatorname{conv}(K)$ 是紧集在连续映射下的像。）}试举一个", "$\\R^2$ 中的例子，说明", "\\emph{闭}集的凸包未必是闭的。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\section{问题：从 Radon 到 Helly、中心点与 Jung", "定理}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) -- (3,0) -- (0.9,2.6) -- cycle;", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.6pt) node[below left] {\\small $A_1$};", "  \\fill (3,0) circle (1.6pt) node[below right] {\\small $A_2$};", "  \\fill (0.9,2.6) circle (1.6pt) node[above] {\\small $A_3$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (1.3,0.9) circle (1.8pt)", "    node[below, omThm] {\\small $A_4$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) -- (3,0.3) -- (3.3,2.4) --", "    (0.4,2.2) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (0,0) -- (3.3,2.4);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (3,0.3) -- (0.4,2.2);", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.6pt) node[below left] {\\small $A_1$};", "  \\fill (3,0.3) circle (1.6pt) node[below right] {\\small $A_2$};", "  \\fill (3.3,2.4) circle (1.6pt) node[above right] {\\small $A_3$};", "  \\fill (0.4,2.2) circle (1.6pt) node[above left] {\\small $A_4$};", "  \\fill[omProp] (1.75,1.27) circle (1.8pt);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 平面上一般位置四点的两种 Radon 型：", "一点位于其余三点构成的三角形内部", "（划分 $\\{A_4\\} \\mid \\{A_1, A_2, A_3\\}$），", "或处于凸位置，此时 Radon 点（橙色）", "为两条对角线的交点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{problem}[{周末问题 --- Helly 定理及其", "两个应用}]\\label{pb:b2:affine:1}", "Radon 引理（\\cref{exo:b2:affine:7}）说明，任意 $n + 2$", "个点（位于 $n$ 维仿射空间中）总可分成两组，使两组的凸包相交。", "本题将这一线性代数事实", "串成一系列组合几何定理：", "Helly 交集定理、中心点定理（二维中位数）", "以及 Jung 覆盖定理。全题中，平面取为", "赋有通常欧几里得结构的 $\\R^2$，", "$\\det$ 为在标准基下的行列式。", "\\index{Helly 定理}\\index{Radon", "引理}\\index{Jung 定理}\\index{中心点}", "", "\\medskip", "\\noindent\\textbf{第一部分 --- 重心坐标。}点", "$A_0, \\dots, A_k$ 称为\\emph{仿射无关}，当", "向量 $\\vect{A_0A_1}, \\dots, \\vect{A_0A_k}$ 线性", "无关。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 证明仿射无关性不依赖于基点 $A_0$ 的选取，", "        且它等价于：若两族权重各自之和为 $1$，", "        并且它们定义出 $(A_0,", "        \\dots, A_k)$ 的同一重心，", "        则两族权重相同。", "  \\item 设 $(A, B, C)$ 在平面中仿射无关，证明每一点 $M$", "        都唯一对应一组三元数 $(\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma)$，", "        满足 $\\alpha + \\beta +", "        \\gamma = 1$ 且 $M = \\operatorname{bar}(A, \\alpha; B,", "        \\beta; C, \\gamma)$ ——称其为\\emph{", "        重心坐标}。", "  \\item 证明行列式公式", "        \\[", "        \\alpha = \\frac{\\det(\\vect{MB},", "        \\vect{MC})}{\\det(\\vect{AB}, \\vect{AC})},", "        \\qquad", "        \\beta = \\frac{\\det(\\vect{MC},", "        \\vect{MA})}{\\det(\\vect{AB}, \\vect{AC})},", "        \\qquad", "        \\gamma = \\frac{\\det(\\vect{MA},", "        \\vect{MB})}{\\det(\\vect{AB}, \\vect{AC})} :", "        \\]", "        重心坐标即为有向面积之比。", "  \\item 直线 $BC$、$CA$、$AB$ 分别为坐标直线", "        $\\{\\alpha = 0\\}$, $\\{\\beta = 0\\}$, $\\{\\gamma = 0\\}$.", "        证明 $M$ 位于闭三角形", "        $\\operatorname{conv}\\{A, B, C\\}$ 内，当且仅当 $\\alpha, \\beta,", "        \\gamma \\geq 0$，并且三条直线将平面恰好分为七个区域，", "        它们由", "        $(\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma)$ 的符号加以区分（符号组 $(-, -,", "        -)$ 不可能出现）。", "  \\item 设 $u \\colon \\R^2 \\to \\R$ 为仿射映射（称为", "        \\emph{仿射型}）。证明 $u(M) = \\alpha\\,u(A) +", "        \\beta\\,u(B) + \\gamma\\,u(C)$，非常值仿射型的水平集为直线，", "        每条直线都以这种方式出现，", "        并且闭半平面 $\\{u", "        \\geq c\\}$ 是凸的。", "\\end{enumerate}", ""]}